 n the park—a fun-filled community celebration and fundraiser you won’t
  want to miss! Though potluck\, we'll make sure to have some basics covere
 d. 📅 Sunday—August 16th\, from 4-7 PM. Mark your calendars for this f
 amily-friendly meetup! Meet Democrat Congressional Candidate Nancy Mannion
 \, Township Supervisor Iber Guerrero-Lopez\, and many other local candidat
 es and elected officials. 🎸 Live music 🍹Ann's Fabulous Sangria! This
  all-ages eve
