 to miss! Though potluck\, we'll make sure to have some basics covered. Thi
 s picnic will take the place of our regularly scheduled second Wednesday o
 f the month meeting. Some business will be covered\, but the bulk of the e
 vening will be dedicated to fun! Wednesday—August 12\, from 5-8 PM. The 
 picnic is at Huffnagle Park\, located along Oak Lane\, between South Churc
 h Str
