DESCRIPTION:Join the Lancaster County Democrats and learn how to get invol
 ved. Whether you are new to the area or new to volunteering with the Democ
 ratic party\, this info session will give you the lay of the land here in 
 Lancaster. Learn about volunteering in your neighborhood\, your local dist
 rict committee\, the county party\, or for a campaign. Virtual google meet
  details will be sent to registered participants the day before the event.
