BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Make Calls with Turn PA Blue for the 2026 General Election!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260825T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260825T170000
UID:fe759c80ff4bd159463eeeb96d23a20f@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/2026TPAB%20Mobilize%20%2824%29_20260527202626329940.png
DESCRIPTION:### Join Turn PA Blue as we make calls for the 2026 General El
 ection! We'll be making calls using the Scale to Win Auto-Dialer\, a compu
 ter program that dials FOR YOU! It's easy to use and allows us to have mor
 e meaningful conversations! All you need is your computer & internet acces
 s! *This phone bank is held on Zoom. At the start of the shift\, we will r
 eview the script and provide dialer training to anyone who needs it. Then 
 we'll make calls together until the end of the shift.*
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/turnpablue/event/962184/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
